ty Owner:<\/strong> Name of the property owner.<\/li>\n<li><strong>Description of Work:<\/strong> Detailed description of the proposed construction or work.<\/li>\n<li><strong>Parcel ID:<\/strong>  Link to associated parcel information, if available.<\/li>\n<\/ul><p><strong>Purpose:<\/strong><\/p><p>This data can be used for a variety of purposes, including:<\/p><ul>\n<li><strong>Tracking development activity:<\/strong> Monitoring building trends and patterns in the jurisdiction.<\/li>\n<li><strong>Planning and zoning:<\/strong> Informing land use decisions and infrastructure planning.<\/li>\n<li><strong>Code enforcement:<\/strong>  Identifying potential violations and ensuring compliance with building codes.<\/li>\n<li><strong>Public information:<\/strong> Providing citizens with information about construction projects in their area.<\/li><\/ul>","tags":["Building Permits","Construction","Development","Planning","Zoning","Butler County Kansas"],"snippet":"This feature service contains information about building permits issued by Butler County Kansas. It includes the location, status, type, and other details for each permit.","thumbnail":"thumbnail/thumbnail.png","documentation":null,"extent":[[-97.6219363648834,-25.168757103375125],[9705794.19411588,374622.907492458]],"categories":[],"spatialReference":"4326","accessInformation":"","classification":null,"licenseInfo":"","culture":"en-us","properties":{"indexJobId":""},"advancedSettings":null,"url":"https://services5.arcgis.com/SU4Aj97XUNDcwkDb/arcgis/rest/services/Permits_Premium/FeatureServer","proxyFilter":null,"access":"public","size":-1,"subInfo":0,"appCategories":[],"industries":[],"languages":[],"largeThumbnail":null,"banner":null,"screenshots":[],"listed":false,"numComments":0,"numRatings":0,"avgRating":0,"numViews":16814,"scoreCompleteness":83,"groupDesignations":null,"apiToken1ExpirationDate":-1,"apiToken2ExpirationDate":-1,"lastViewed":1792206000000,"source":"Butler County GIS"},{"id":"1bb2292a068c493a912ad473daca8741","owner":"AHumes","created":1741101983000,"modified":1788538056000,"guid":null,"name":"Farmland2025","title":"Farmland Visible Layer","type":"Feature Service","typeKeywords":["ArcGIS Server","Data","Feature Access","Feature Service","Metadata","Service","Singlelayer","Hosted Service"],"description":"<div><div>For Butler County Planning, Farmland Preservation; Sheryl Kelly <\/div>This was created at the request of Sheryl Kelly, her vison was to have a &quot;live&quot; preserved farm layer available by link from the preservation page, as well as the mapping page (eventually the county hub site that we are currently working on).<\/div>This layer was created to visually show all of the parcels of land that are included in current farms preserved by agricultural conservation easements. <div>Farms Layer = Farm Count Layer = FarmlandPreservation_withAC Layer (127 Count) in FARMLANDS Project. <\/div><div>Associated with: Preserved Farms Web Map (Farmland Count Layer, Soils Layer, Parcels_March2025 Layer), Preserved Farms Dashboard, and Farmland Preservation Web Experience.<br /><div><br /><\/div><\/div><div>Updated Farmlands as of 3/4/25<\/div>","tags":["Farmland Preservation","Butler County PA","Project"],"snippet":"This layer was created to visually show all of the parcels of land that are included in current farms preserved by agricultural conservation easements. Updated Farmlands as of 3/4/25","thumbnail":"thumbnail/thumbnail.png","documentation":null,"extent":[[-80.16279313308884,40.675589398660826],[-79.706425081932,41.13729156565246]],"categories":["/Categories/Planning/Farmland Preservation"],"spatialReference":"102729","accessInformation":"","classification":null,"licenseInfo":"To be used in farmland preservation web map / dashboard for Butler County PA Farmland Preservation.","culture":"en-us","properties":null,"advancedSettings":null,"url":"https://services9.arcgis.com/5VOhDgerxIw33LoH/arcgis/rest/services/Farmland2025/FeatureServer","proxyFilter":null,"access":"public","size":-1,"subInfo":0,"appCategories":[],"industries":[],"languages":[],"largeThumbnail":null,"banner":null,"screenshots":[],"listed":false,"numComments":0,"numRatings":0,"avgRating":0,"numViews":586,"scoreCompleteness":100,"groupDesignations":null,"apiToken1ExpirationDate":-1,"apiToken2ExpirationDate":-1,"lastViewed":1792191600000,"licenseConstraintId":"custom"},{"id":"f6ca849796f04248b6726b441506ad9b","owner":"AHumes","created":1746734496000,"modified":1788537981000,"guid":null,"name":"FarmLayerAC","title":"Farmland Count Layer","type":"Feature Service","typeKeywords":["ArcGIS Server","Data","Feature Access","Feature Service","Metadata","Service","Singlelayer","Hosted Service"],"description":"<div>For Butler County Planning, Farmland Preservation; Sheryl Kelly <\/div>This was created at the request of Sheryl Kelly, her vison was to have a &quot;live&quot; preserved farm layer available by link from the preservation page, as well as the mapping page (eventually the county hub site that we are currently working on).<div>This layer was designed to &quot;Create&quot; a count of the farms preserved, rather than have a count of the number of parcels. Farms layer is not visible on the Preserved Farms web map, it is only there for the statistics to be used in the dashboard that was created for Sheryl. Farm Count Layer = Farms Layer = Farmland_Preservation_Layer (77 Count) in Farmland2025 Project. <div>Associated with: Preserved Farms Web Map (Farmland Visible Layer, Soils Layer, Parcels_March2025 Layer), Preserved Farms Dashboard, and  Farmland Preservation Web Experience.<\/div><\/div>","tags":["Farmland Preservation","Butler County PA","Project"],"snippet":"This layer was designed to \"Create\" a count of the farms preserved, rather than have a count of the number of parcels.","thumbnail":"thumbnail/thumbnail.png","documentation":null,"extent":[[-80.16279313308884,40.675589398660826],[-79.706425081932,41.13729156565246]],"categories":["/Categories/